and they\u2019ll stay longer, spend more, and want to come back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/GROW.png?t=1747087050\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/GROW.gif?t=1747087050\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As your park gets more popular, it\u2019s time to expand. Unlock new areas to grow your waterpark\u2019s size and hire staff to handle the daily chaos. With a team in place, you can focus on what really matters\u2014building the best waterpark possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/Waterpark-Sim_Steam_Wishlist.gif?t=1747087050\" /> </p>","developers":["CayPlay"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/310bed8696a5b1262963ecbee04398a491506360/header.jpg?t=1747087050","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257137513,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137513/movie480.mp4?t=1747087048","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137513/movie_max.mp4?t=1747087048"},"name":"Waterpark Simulator | Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257137513/2a099ddfbf83ede9ed5898c111a44a7f5ac52a7c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747087048","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137513/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747087048","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137513/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747087048"}}],"name":"Waterpark Simu